In case of pension to the spouse in case of death of beneficiary:

 1. Copy of death certificate of the late beneficiary in original or self-attested;
 1. Documentary proof to support that the late beneficiary was getting artistes pension;
 1. Legal heir certificate in the prescribed proforma issued by the Competent Authority and an affidavit from SDM or 1st Class Magistrate in proforma;
 1. Self-attested copy of the Digital Life Certificate (DLC) of the spouse processed through Jeevan Pramaan Portal https://jeevanpramaan.gov.in
 1. Self-attested copy of the latest Income Certificate of the spouse in the prescribed format [Annexure-II(A)] issued by the concerned Competent Authority of the States/UTs[Annexure-II(B)];
 1. Self-attested copy of Aadhaar Card of spouse issued by UIDAI;
 1. Self-attested copy of any document in support of address proof of the spouse.
 1. An undertaking that he/she is not getting financial assistance under other Schemes of the Ministry of Culture or other Ministry/Department of Central Government for the same purpose.
 1. Bank Authorization Letter in the prescribed format (Annexure-IV)

description:
